"""New vocab cards for Vehicle Networks (pack net). Row = [term, plain meaning, shop tip].
Sources: ISO 11898-2/-3 (CAN physical layers), Bosch CAN 2.0 spec, ISO 11898-1 / CAN FD, SAE J2411 (single-wire CAN),
ISO 17987 (LIN), SAE J1962 (OBD connector), SAE J1979 (OBD-II services), ISO 14229 (UDS), ISO 15765-2 (ISO-TP),
SAE J2534 (pass-thru), IEEE 802.3bw / 802.3bp / 802.3cg (automotive Ethernet), ISO 13400 (DoIP), IEEE 802.1AS (gPTP)."""

